message: "If you use these bounds, data or verifiers, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "Certified bounds for the Mertens function: lim sup M(x)/sqrt(x) > 2.06175 and lim inf M(x)/sqrt(x) < -2.06471"
authors:
  - family-names: Weisz
    given-names: Benjamin
repository-code: "https://github.com/wbeni95/mertens-function-bounds"
